---@field notSelectedPatchCount? number The number of patches that were detected as available for install, but did not meet the operation's criteria.
---@field pendingPatchCount? number The number of patches that were identified as meeting the installation criteria, but were not able to be installed. Typically this happens when maintenanceWindowExceeded == true.
---@field installedPatchCount? number The number of patches successfully installed.
---@field failedPatchCount? number The number of patches that could not be installed due to some issue. See errors for details.
